/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/linkedin.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;linkedin&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 8px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.linkedin.com/in/nityan&quot;&gt;http://www.linkedin.com/in/nityan&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;list-style-type: none; margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/instagram.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;instagram&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 8px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://instagram.com/sketchthedocs&quot;&gt;sketchthedocs&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;list-style-type: none; margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/bluesky.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;bluesky&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 8px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://bsky.app/profile/nitya.dev&quot;&gt;@nitya.dev&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;list-style-type: none; margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/twitter.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;twitter&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 8px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/nitya&quot;&gt;@nitya&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;list-style-type: none; margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/link.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;link&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 8px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://huggingface.co/nityan&quot;&gt;https://huggingface.co/nityan&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Popular Repository&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/nitya/agent-optimization-workshop&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;agent-optimization-workshop&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;In this workshop learn how to use the Microsoft Foundry Observability platform capabilities with GitHub Copilot coding agent support, to …&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Other Repositories (Pinned)&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/Azure/Cloud-Native&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud-Native&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/star.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;star&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;273 &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/git-fork.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;git-fork&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;78&lt;br&gt;This is a showcase on Azure Cloud Native, the products, events and how to get started or go deep with cloud native technologies, including Serverless on Azure.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/microsoft/generative-ai-for-beginners&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;generative-ai-for-beginners&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/star.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;star&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;121k &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/git-fork.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;git-fork&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;63.6k&lt;br&gt;21 Lessons, Get Started Building with Generative AI &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/Azure-Samples/contoso-chat&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;contoso-chat&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/star.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;star&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;766 &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/git-fork.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;git-fork&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;3.9k&lt;br&gt;This sample has the full End2End process of creating RAG application with Prompty and Azure AI Foundry. It includes GPT-4 LLM application code, evaluations, deployment automation with AZD CLI, GitHub actions for evaluation and deployment and intent mapping for multiple LLM task mapping.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/microsoft/model-mondays&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;model-mondays&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/star.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;star&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;295 &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/git-fork.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;git-fork&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;54&lt;br&gt;Model Mondays is a weekly livestream with Discord office hours - to help you navigate the fast-moving ecosystem of generative AI models with 5-minute roundups and 15-minute spotlight sessions. Build your model IQ - and make informed model choices!&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/Azure/awesome-azd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;awesome-azd&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/star.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;star&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;271 &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/git-fork.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;git-fork&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;178&lt;br&gt;An awesome list that curates content (articles, videos, tutorials and docs) and templates (ready to use) for the Azure Developer CLI (`azd`). Plus a hosted azd-templates Gallery to simplify search &amp;amp; discovery&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/microsoft/ignite25-PREL13-observe-manage-and-scale-agentic-ai-apps-with-microsoft-foundry&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ignite25-PREL13-observe-manage-and-scale-agentic-ai-apps-with-microsoft-foundry&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/star.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;star&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;45 &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/git-fork.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;git-fork&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;157&lt;br&gt;Learn How To Observe, Manage, and Scale, Agentic AI Apps Using Azure AI Foundry - with this hands-on workshop&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
      
